{"content_hash":"49e14a2da42a9183cbd56c61d8f2fc3387aac21bebe7eb7b0683e4ea680ef46b","html":"\u003ch2 id=\"prerequisites\"\u003ePrerequisites\u003ca class=\"sarde-heading-anchor\" href=\"#prerequisites\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Prerequisites\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRust 1.93\u003c/strong\u003e or later (stable toolchain).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA C compiler\u003c/strong\u003e for the vendored Oniguruma build (\u003ccode\u003eonig-sys\u003c/code\u003e). On Windows, install Visual Studio with the \u0026#34;Desktop development with C++\u0026#34; workload. On Linux and macOS, the system \u003ccode\u003ecc\u003c/code\u003e is enough.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"add-the-crate\"\u003eAdd the crate\u003ca class=\"sarde-heading-anchor\" href=\"#add-the-crate\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Add the crate\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdd \u003ccode\u003eirosashi\u003c/code\u003e to your \u003ccode\u003eCargo.toml\u003c/code\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"kazari-block not-content\" data-lines=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cfigure class=\"frame has-title\" data-lang=\"toml\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"kz-toolbar\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"kz-toolbar-left\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"kz-lang\"\u003eToml\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"kz-file-icon\" data-ext=\"toml\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"kz-title\"\u003eCargo.toml\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"kz-toolbar-right\"\u003e\u003cbutton class=\"kz-copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy\" data-tooltip=\"Copy\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"[dependencies]irosashi = \u0026#34;0.1\u0026#34;\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"kz-copy-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\u003e\u003cpath stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2